<title>USA: Wall Street stocks jump higher at opening.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks jump higher at opening.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks vaulted higher at the opening on Friday after fresh economic data reinforced the outlook that the economy is steadily slowing.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrials opened up 16 at 6329</p>
</text>
